  tentacleengineers: { w: "squid-kin engineer with an orange body and teal suckers, a big pointed orange mantle fin hood with round yellow goggles, a teal-and-navy work coat with a heavy navy apron and tool-loop belt, a backpack of cables, navy flippers, and a different tool in each of several arms: a wrench, a blue-flame torch, a plasma drill, a handheld scanner and pliers", p: "a flooded workshop with a half-built scrap turret, a welding rig, parts bins, a generator, a pile of drones" },
